        },
        {
          "text": "Tolim Elicha tama, “Nakinae chene ngakiria ngadi.” Abu kipurupurak namot tolim tama, “Toodokisi kesi nabo akimuj ache.” Nakaneni amam ibore aronon ayei nakimuj ngina.",
          "type": "text",
